{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45970","headline":"寄杭州灵隐寺宋震使君 · 贯休","name":"寄杭州灵隐寺宋震使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢郡归侵夏，仍闻灵隐居。\n僧房谢朓语，寺额葛洪书。\n月树猕猴睡，山池菡萏疎。\n吾皇爱清静，莫便结吾庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}